  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Welcome to SeaGrove Sanctuary; a beautifully decorated, luxurious and serene beach escape. SeaGrove Sanctuary is a spacious 4 bedroom, 4 and a half bath multistory home. <br>From the moment you arrive, you’re enveloped in subtle beauty. The landscaping is lush and true to the native environment. A pathway leads to an outdoor seating area with a fire pit. Enjoy the breeze under the oaks, and watch life go by on 30A. <br>Inside the house, an sunny entry way invites you in and leads to the single car garage access, with an extra refrigerator for those beach drinks and snacks. This is where you will find the complimentary six seater golf cart as well, perfect for hauling all the beach essentials. <br>The first floor has a bedroom with a queen sized bed and an en-suite bath. <br>There is also a fun bunk room with 4 twin bunk beds (4 beds) and an additional extra long twin bed. This room is equipped with a TV and a selection of board games to enjoy after a fun day at the beach. There is a bath attached to the bunk room. <br>Heading upstairs, take in the lovely views through the sets of doors leading out to the balcony. The living and dining areas are open to the kitchen, so that everyone can be included in the fun. The space is furnished in modern, upscale style and offers plenty of room for relaxing. The kitchen is open and well equipped with top of the line appliances and special touches like a Soda Stream. There is also a laundry room with a full sized washer and dryer. A half bath can also be found on the second level. The second level wraps up with a lovely master suite. The suite has a king bed and a seating area with a comfortable couch and a smart TV. The room is an en suite with a shower/tub combination. <br>The third floor is a great space to prepare a drink in the wet bar area and head out to the balcony to enjoy the sparkling Gulf views from the balcony. If you must work while on vacation, the third floor offers a desk space. There is also a beautiful second master suite with a king bed, smart TV, and attached bath with a soaking tub and separate shower. <br>The neighborhood features a wonderful, multilevel community pool, grilling area, and sun deck. The small, exclusive neighborhood is gated for privacy and offers access to a state forest. Take a cruise on the provided golf cart to explore this lovely area, or jump on one of the provided bikes (4 adult bikes), and take a ride to explore some of the great areas on 30A. There is also a charger provided for your EV! <br>*There are ONLY 2 parking spaces available.* The owners of the home have taken great care in selecting finishes and furnishings that are modern, luxurious, and welcoming. SeaGrove Sanctuary is truly an amazing escape from reality!<br><br>*please note, there are 3 public beach access points within 5 minutes of the house. There is not a private beach access. <br><br>*booking guest must be over 25, and present for the entire stay. No smoking, no pets. The house is monitored with exterior cameras. No more than three minors per adult. <br>30A~24~7~365, inc provides a starter amount of paper towels, toilet paper, and basic soaps designed to get you through the first day. Please do not remove linens from the home. <br>*golf cart and bikes require waiver releases.<br>*PARKING FOR TWO VEHICLES ONLY! NO STREET PARKING PER HOA!",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "includes golf cart! SeaNest stunner with Gulf views, 4 adult bikes. EV charger"
        }
      ],
